WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Ryu blocks Drive Impact against the wall.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.550
Crouching heavy kick catches the resulting wall splat.

3
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.100
The sweep target follow-up continues the juggle.

4
00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:04.200
Heavy Somersault Kick finishes the wall-splat route.

5
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:04.250
Ryu lands after the wall conversion.
